msgid "a bot answers"
msgstr "een bot antwoordt"

#: admin/class-settings.php:495
msgid "people answer"
msgstr "mensen antwoorden"

#: admin/class-settings.php:496
msgid "live chat with optional bot"
msgstr "livechat met optionele bot"

#: admin/class-settings.php:497
msgid "staffing unknown"
msgstr "bemensing onbekend"

#: admin/class-settings.php:508
msgid "Does this site run a chat?"
msgstr "Draait er een chat op deze site?"

#: admin/class-settings.php:515
msgid "Not decided yet"
msgstr "Nog niet besloten"

#: admin/class-settings.php:524
msgid "An AI answers"
msgstr "Een AI antwoordt"

#: admin/class-settings.php:525
msgid "People answer, an AI sometimes"
msgstr "Mensen antwoorden, soms een AI"

#: admin/class-settings.php:526
msgid "Only people answer"
msgstr "Alleen mensen antwoorden"

#: admin/class-settings.php:530
msgid ""
"The notice appears only with \"Yes\" and an AI that answers at least "
"sometimes."
msgstr ""
"De melding verschijnt alleen bij „Ja“ en een AI die minstens soms antwoordt."

#: admin/class-settings.php:534
msgid "Notice"
msgstr "Melding"

#: admin/class-settings.php:536 includes/class-chatbot.php:111
msgid "You are chatting with an AI system."
msgstr "Je chat met een AI-systeem."

#: admin/class-settings.php:542
msgid ""
"As the first message of the bot (AI Engine; otherwise next to the widget)"
msgstr "Als eerste bericht van de bot (AI Engine; anders naast de widget)"

#: admin/class-settings.php:543
msgid "Next to the chat widget"
msgstr "Naast de chatwidget"

#: admin/class-settings.php:544
msgid "As a line at the end of every page"
msgstr "Als regel aan het einde van elke pagina"

#: admin/class-settings.php:555
msgid ""
"The plugin matches your installed plugins against a bundled list of known AI"
" tools and lets you declare others by hand. Which of them visitors get told "
"about is decided per system on the AI Systems page; nothing is switched on "
"from a finding alone. The list ships with the plugin, nothing is fetched."
msgstr ""
"De plugin vergelijkt je geïnstalleerde plugins met een meegeleverde lijst "
"van bekende AI-tools en laat je andere handmatig declareren. Waarover "
"bezoekers worden geïnformeerd, wordt per systeem beslist op de pagina AI-"
"systemen; niets wordt ingeschakeld op basis van een vondst alleen. De lijst "
"wordt met de plugin meegeleverd, er wordt niets opgehaald."

#: admin/class-settings.php:558
msgid "Visitor notice"
msgstr "Bezoekersvermelding"

#: admin/class-settings.php:561
msgid "Show a notice naming the AI systems marked as visible on every page"
msgstr ""
"Op elke pagina een vermelding tonen met de AI-systemen die als zichtbaar "
"zijn gemarkeerd"

#: admin/class-settings.php:568
msgid "Line at the end of the page"
msgstr "Regel onderaan de pagina"

#: admin/class-settings.php:569
msgid "Small badge in a corner"
msgstr "Kleine badge in een hoek"

#: admin/class-settings.php:579
msgid "Notice text"
msgstr "Berichttekst"

#. translators: %s: names of the visible AI systems.
#. translators: %s: comma-separated names of AI systems.
